msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "BED"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hang on! My Content Aware is going off!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Betty is a real sensual being—talking to her is going to get pretty intensely spicy!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "There will also be a liiittle bit of horror when she talks to an old friend."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You cool with that? Or you want to skip it?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's skip it please!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay with this type of stuff."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "No worries - hey, Betty!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Hey hon. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How would you like your relationship with Betty to resolve?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Betty's face flushes at the prospect of love. You can rest well, now."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-0/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's love!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-0/32 betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-1/51 betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-2/35
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you out there on the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "What say the two of you just be friends, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-1/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Sure! I can always use a new friend!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rest well, Betty's friendship is yours forevermore."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-1/31
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Aww... friends forever."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It was never meant to be for you and Betty - her kind face frowns at the prospect of continuing to sleep with you nonetheless."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-2/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Enjoy your... hateship."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-0/45/c-2/68 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-6/81 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/81 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/94
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "All I can say is... You made your bed, but you are <i>not</i> laying in it!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/skylar_betty_content/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Carry on, then!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Standing here in your bedroom you're struck by the realization that it's been entirely too long since you had anyone near your bed who wasn't... well, you."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How strange then, that the beauty standing before you feels so familiar even though you're certain you've never seen her in your life."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's all curves and comfort, a soft body and softer facial features that seem to invite one closer subconsciously. She's positively enchanting."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/27
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Hey there, stranger."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do I know you?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do I feel like I know you?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Of course you do, honey."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You know who I am!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Because you do!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I'm Betty—and I'm your bed."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "We've been sleeping together so many years it would be a little weird if you <i>didn't</i> know me, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been sleeping with a beautiful woman and I didn't know it?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like I'd definitely remember sleeping with someone as pretty as you..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been alone for a lot longer than I'd like to admit."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't care I want to skip."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "A beautiful bed, anyway..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I've been here for it all, darlin'. But we can make some new memories from here on."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You've never been alone, sugar. I've always been here."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-0/c-6/7 betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/33
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, hitting the hay already?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "It's a shame for someone as cute as you to be alone for so long, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Will you be bringing someone back here anytime soon?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not really my thing."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope so... I haven't been alone by choice."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't see how it's any of your business."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh I see! But you know, even if it isn't..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "There are so many other nice things you can do in bed with a partner."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Cuddling for one... reading side by side..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's more my speed."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean I like sex, I'm just not there yet currently."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/31/c-0/11
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "That's wonderful. Some of the most intimate acts are non-sexual, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/31/c-0/19
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I wish more people understood that."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh I see... noted."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Don't you worry."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I have a <i>strong</i> feeling that'll be changing soon."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Well... you sleep on me, don't you? It's a little of my business."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, by the way... Skylar told me everything."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But don't you worry. I might be here now, but you can still sleep in your bed just like you always do."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You can choose to talk to me or not."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But I do hope you'll come talk to me... it'd be nice to finally get to know each other."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to get to know you better."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to know you on a more intimate level."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep dreaming, lady."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh how lovely... come back soon then, cutie."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh but I already know you <i>intimately</i>."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But I suppose it wouldn't hurt to know more, would it?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Aww... don't be like that."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-2/c-12/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Just think of all the fun we could have together..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Well, anyway, I'll be here. See you tonight."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like I have no choice."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a date."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you tonight!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Well if you want to put it like that... I guess."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I can't wait."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "See you then!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Sorry I'm late. I took a look at Roomers and got caught up in some real headscratchers..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/14
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "We can talk about it later. For now, let's go to sleep."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/22
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Today I kept you on a tight schedule - but tomorrow is a brand new day - and you can truly experience your new powers to your heart's content."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/41
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Come get comfortable, then."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/49
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Good night..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_introduction/0/g-4/60
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/6
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Hey there..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's with that smile?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh. Don't tell me I said something embarrassing in my sleep."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, nothing... hehe."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You didn't so much <i>say</i> anything..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh nothing really... it's just..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You were very... <i>animated</i> last night."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/14
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You seemed quite happy about something."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/22
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I wonder what sort of dream you were having?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was eating the most incredible meatball sub... 8 feet long and about this wide..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was uh... well... it's a little embarrassing..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You watch me when I sleep? Weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh. Well. I guess that would explain the uh, movements of your hands... and the sounds you were making..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh dear. I was... way off base with my guess."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Don't be embarrassed... I'd love to hear all about it."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Well it's my job, isn't it? You sleep on me, after all."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Am I supposed to just close my eyes and pretend you aren't there? Don't be silly."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "After seeing you be so, hmm, <i>lively</i> last night..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I was hoping to hear a little bit more about what you're into."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You can learn so much about people from their dreams, you know."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's really none of your goddamn business."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My dreams aren't all that interesting, but..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My dreams are always nonsense."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/7 betty_bed/betty_interaction2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Aww, don't be like that."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I have to see the other side of them, you know... you might as well tell me what you're seeing."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Maybe you're not quite comfortable enough with me yet. I can understand if you need a little more time."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Just think about opening up a little for me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/39
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Maybe I'll share a little something about myself with you too."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't hold your breath."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I suppose we will, won't we..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-0/15 betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-4/0 betty_bed/betty_sexy_dream/0/g-4/0 betty_bed/betty_ace_bed_routine/0/g-3/0 betty_bed/betty_ace_false_end/0/c-0/39 betty_bed/betty_ace_false_end/0/c-1/51 betty_bed/betty_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "See you tonight."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You're no fun, you know."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/47/c-1/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "See you tonight, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I'll be the judge of that. Go on..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Maybe so, but you can divine a surprising amount even from the nonsense."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_interaction1/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Go on... tell me."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was trapped in a giant bowl of pudding and had to eat my way out..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was a cartoon duck, swimming in a pool of gold coins..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I had the ability to fly, but only if I doggy-paddled in the air..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Hm. I'm not sure if that sounds appealing or disgusting."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Pudding CAN be sexy... but maybe not in that amount."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, to be a cartoon duck in a pool of gold coins... so luxurious."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, I've had dreams like that too."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Not the doggy paddling, but... you know, you're given the opportunity to do something amazing but in the most embarrassing manner."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Are your dreams always like this?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Define 'like this'."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/9/s/0 betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0 betty_bed/betty_interaction5/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't usually remember my dreams."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You know... relatively pleasant."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Unfortunately no."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "How lovely. I wish I could say the same for myself."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "You and I are in the same boat, then."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Maybe it's for the best if you find you don't remember yours."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh, that must be so lovely... I wish I could say the same for myself."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh really? Perhaps it's for the best."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Sometimes I wish I could forget mine."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_dream/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Betty"
