#: betty_bed/betty_date_dancing/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Honestly I'm just happy getting to spend time with you."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_date_dancing/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But I can't wait for more."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_date_dancing/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I've had some fun dates, don't get me wrong, but..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_date_dancing/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I've never been with someone where I felt this happy just being near them."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_date_dancing/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Anything we do is going to be so special."
