#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Betty exhales, but she seems relieved rather than upset."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/8
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh thank goodness. You know, I just care about you so much."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/16
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I think I can really be happy as long as you and I are alright."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/24
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "If you can just give me some time to transition here..."
