#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure it's going to be okay?"
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_friendshipending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Thank you so much. You're always so understanding."
