#: betty_bed/betty_ace_false_end/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Well, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_false_end/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But I think I'm gonna go. Lots to think about."
