#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-6/35 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-0/32 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/35 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you return for bed that night, Betty isn't there."
