#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-6/40 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-0/37 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/40 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
