#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-0/88 betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-1/97
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "All I can say is... You made your bed, and yet you <i>are</i> laying in it!"
