#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-1/29
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But that was good. I'd do it again too."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-1/37
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "But I can't even look at you right now..."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/39/c-1/48
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Just get away from me."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you walk away from Betty she's surprised, but her anger quickly turns to sadness."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She runs off into the bathroom, her crying echoing off the tile and haunting you even when you leave the room."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure if Betty wants to slap you or kiss you, but it doesn't take her long to do neither of those things."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her lip trembles, and then she's walking away from you, stifling a sob with her hand."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She walks off into the bathroom, slamming the door behind her."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_hateending/0/g-1/c-8/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her crying echoes off the tile, the sound of her sadness haunting you even when you leave the room."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_love_return/0
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "There you are... I was just thinking about you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: betty_bed/betty_ace_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Betty"
